#: applications/luci-app-tinyproxy/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tinyproxy/tinyproxy.js:206
msgid ""
"List of allowed ports for the CONNECT method. A single value '0' disables "
"CONNECT completely, an empty list allows all ports"
msgstr ""
"Liste over tillatte porter for CONNECT-metoden. En enkelt verdi '0' "
"deaktiverer CONNECT fullstendig, en tom liste tillater alle porter"

